{"id":"chatcmpl-92d34e45-8b45-45c3-a008-5fe806ac0edd","object":"chat.completion","created":1795245202,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task resolves a binary visual finding (presence and laterality of a catheter) by triangulating multiple independent visual QA tools rather than trusting a single model. The key move is escalating from a quick expert query to a cross-check, then to a grounded report with coordinates when outputs conflict. Final answer selection relies on the tool that provides spatial grounding plus corroborating image markers (e.g., laterality labels).\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a binary visual finding must be localized to a side, query at least two independent visual QA tools and treat disagreement as a signal to escalate to a more grounded method.\",\n    \"Prefer tools that return spatial grounding (coordinates/regions) over free-text answers when resolving conflicting or ambiguous findings.\",\n    \"Use in-image markers (laterality labels, orientation cues) as independent corroboration for any side-specific conclusion.\",\n    \"Sequence tools from cheap/fast expert query to cross-check to grounded report, stopping escalation only when outputs converge.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging QA\": \"Start with a domain-expert VLM for the specific finding, cross-check with a second VLM, and escalate to a grounded/coordinate-returning model when answers conflict or laterality matters.\",\n    \"Binary classification with localization\": \"Convert the binary question into a 'presence + where' query so tools must commit to a location, making disagreement detectable.\",\n    \"Conflicting model outputs\": \"Treat conflict as a trigger for a higher-fidelity tool rather than majority voting; weight grounded/coordinate evidence highest.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the finding's laterality against an independent in-image cue (marker, orientation) before finalizing.\",\n    \"Verify that at least one tool provided spatial grounding when the answer depends on side or location.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":535,"total_tokens":921,"completion_tokens":386,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":535},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":386}}}